WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.467 --> 00:00:18.200
"It is so hot," Jason said.

2
00:00:18.201 --> 00:00:21.324
He fanned himself with his notebook in the gym.

3
00:00:21.325 --> 00:00:24.460
"I know. I'm sweating.

4
00:00:24.461 --> 00:00:28.245
And I'm just standing here," Bobby said.

5
00:00:28.246 --> 00:00:30.990
Miss Shelly blew her whistle.

6
00:00:30.991 --> 00:00:34.766
There was a large cooler by her feet.

7
00:00:34.767 --> 00:00:41.760
"Today I brought strawberries, bananas, peaches, milk, and ice cream.

8
00:00:41.761 --> 00:00:46.101
We're going to make an ice-cold treat," she said.

9
00:00:46.102 --> 00:00:50.258
"Milk shakes!" Izzie cried, jumping up and down.

10
00:00:50.259 --> 00:00:54.162
"Yes," Bobby said, pumping his fist.

11
00:00:54.163 --> 00:00:59.339
"Mmm . . . I like peach milk shakes," Nina said.

12
00:00:59.340 --> 00:01:04.056
Jason stared at the ice cream in the cooler.

13
00:01:04.057 --> 00:01:07.819
"Milk shakes are easy to make," Miss Shelly explained.

14
00:01:07.820 --> 00:01:12.121
"All we do is put the ingredients into the blender and—"

15
00:01:12.122 --> 00:01:16.166
"Blend, blend, blend!" finished Izzie.

16
00:01:16.167 --> 00:01:18.037
Nina read the first step.

17
00:01:18.038 --> 00:01:22.799
"Put strawberries into the blender."

18
00:01:22.800 --> 00:01:26.650
"Then add one ripe banana," Bobby said.

19
00:01:26.651 --> 00:01:30.342
"And one cup of peaches," Jason said.

20
00:01:30.343 --> 00:01:37.325
"Next add one and a half cups of vanilla ice cream. Yum," Izzie said.

21
00:01:37.326 --> 00:01:40.786
She scooped ice cream into the measuring cup.

22
00:01:40.787 --> 00:01:45.594
"Then we put in one and a half cups of ice cubes," Nina said.

23
00:01:45.595 --> 00:01:50.415
"Ooh, it's cold in the cooler!"

24
00:01:50.416 --> 00:01:55.382
"And then add half a cup of milk," Izzie said, pouring carefully.

25
00:01:55.383 --> 00:01:58.871
"Wow! We're done already."

26
00:01:58.872 --> 00:02:02.404
"Almost done," Miss Shelly corrected.

27
00:02:02.405 --> 00:02:07.575
"Jason, will you put the lid on the blender and turn it on for us?"

28
00:02:07.576 --> 00:02:13.855
Jason put the lid on the blender and turned it on. Whirrrrrr . . .

29
00:02:13.856 --> 00:02:18.496
The blender hummed and buzzed as the blades spun around.

30
00:02:18.497 --> 00:02:22.725
The kids heard the ice cubes crack and bang against the glass.

31
00:02:22.726 --> 00:02:25.988
Then the sound became softer.

32
00:02:25.989 --> 00:02:30.377
"I think our milk shakes are ready," Miss Shelly said.

33
00:02:30.378 --> 00:02:36.005
She filled Nina, Bobby, and Izzie's glasses with ice-cold milk shakes.

34
00:02:36.006 --> 00:02:40.775
When she reached for Jason's, he suddenly put his hands over the glass.

35
00:02:40.776 --> 00:02:43.908
"No!" he cried.

36
00:02:43.909 --> 00:02:46.250
"Jason, what's the matter?

37
00:02:46.251 --> 00:02:50.144
Don't you want to try the milk shake?" Miss Shelly asked.

38
00:02:50.145 --> 00:02:53.586
"No," he said again, shaking his head.

39
00:02:53.587 --> 00:02:56.469
Everyone looked at Jason.

40
00:02:56.470 --> 00:03:00.113
"Why not?" Bobby asked.

41
00:03:00.114 --> 00:03:05.312
"Yeah, it's really good," Izzie said, taking a sip of hers.

42
00:03:05.313 --> 00:03:09.996
"Well, actually I don't like milk." Jason looked down.

43
00:03:09.997 --> 00:03:12.267
"And I don't like ice cream either.

44
00:03:12.268 --> 00:03:15.702
I'm weird, okay?"

45
00:03:15.703 --> 00:03:18.801
"You're not weird." Bobby grinned.

46
00:03:18.802 --> 00:03:23.724
"Well, you are weird, but not because of that."

47
00:03:23.725 --> 00:03:25.722
"I am weird.

48
00:03:25.723 --> 00:03:28.005
Kids are supposed to like milk.

49
00:03:28.006 --> 00:03:32.392
Kids are supposed to love ice cream," Jason said.

50
00:03:32.393 --> 00:03:36.475
"Kids don't have to like anything," Miss Shelly said.

51
00:03:36.476 --> 00:03:40.857
"And it's so easy to make a fruit smoothie instead of a milk shake.

52
00:03:40.858 --> 00:03:44.966
We'll just use juice instead of milk and ice cream."

53
00:03:44.967 --> 00:03:46.874
She dug through the cooler.

54
00:03:46.875 --> 00:03:50.761
"Aha! I knew I had mango juice!"

55
00:03:50.762 --> 00:03:56.649
Everyone helped put strawberries, banana, peaches, ice cubes, and juice into the blender.

56
00:03:56.650 --> 00:04:03.704
Whirrr. Jason's fruit smoothie was done in a minute.

57
00:04:03.705 --> 00:04:06.366
"Thanks, guys." He took a sip.

58
00:04:06.367 --> 00:04:14.780
"Mmm! Smoothies are great!"
